<title>MALAYSIA: Yeo Hiap Seng Malaysia 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Yeo Hiap Seng Malaysia 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	30.3	  vs	 28.2</p>
<p>    Net profit		  25.35	 vs	 23.67</p>
<p>    Turnover		   471.86	 vs	431.38</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    34.61	 vs	 31.94</p>
<p>    Minorities		   0.27	 vs	  0.25</p>
<p>    Final div  (percent)    11.0	  vs	 11.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Yeo Hiap Seng (Malaysia) Bhd makes and sells canned food, instant noodles and non-alcoholic beverages.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
